WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.090
Today is the day where we celebrate the change

00:00:09.115 --> 00:00:19.742
of the axis of the Sun and that He moves

00:00:20.031 --> 00:00:24.447
towards the tropic of cancer.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.656
Tropic of cancer is the one

00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:43.365
which represents the motherhood,

00:00:48.572 --> 00:00:54.031
the motherhood of the Earth.

00:01:01.739 --> 00:01:07.406
This tropic of Cancer has passed through

00:01:08.406 --> 00:01:11.406
quite a big area of land

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:16.115
while the tropic of Capricorn has not.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:22.073
And the area through which it has passed

00:01:23.697 --> 00:01:26.323
it has created

00:01:28.614 --> 00:01:37.781
different beautiful manifestation

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:44.365
of the motherhood qualities on this Earth.

00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:50.115
We celebrate this change

00:01:52.656 --> 00:01:57.073
because the Sun has now moved into the new

00:02:00.323 --> 00:02:05.614
dimension so that all over the world

00:02:08.489 --> 00:02:14.240
there will be the warmth of the Sun.

00:02:18.406 --> 00:02:20.656
Warmth of the Sun

00:02:22.115 --> 00:02:27.323
represents the warmth of God's love.

00:02:29.531 --> 00:02:32.739
This is the reason why we celebrate

00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:38.531
this festival

00:02:39.989 --> 00:02:42.406
by giving you some sort of a sweet

00:02:43.073 --> 00:02:45.823
made out of sesame seeds.

00:02:46.406 --> 00:02:55.572
Sesame seeds are given because they are also heat giving

00:02:56.864 --> 00:03:00.823
and now as we are coming from the cold,

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:07.406
we come to the hot season, in a way hotter season,

00:03:08.073 --> 00:03:13.365
so to prepare you with that warmth of the Sun.

00:03:15.405 --> 00:03:19.614
These special things are made out of the seed

00:03:20.198 --> 00:03:25.781
of sesame to represent the oncoming warmth

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:31.115
and the warm of the Sun.

00:03:33.614 --> 00:03:36.531
Though in India the heat is too much,

00:03:37.198 --> 00:03:43.989
still people are waiting for this time to come in

00:03:44.656 --> 00:03:48.405
and they celebrate it with such a warm heart.

00:03:48.864 --> 00:03:53.406
At this time it is said that

00:03:55.572 --> 00:04:02.697
they give you this sesame seed and the sugar to eat,

00:04:03.281 --> 00:04:07.365
but now you must speak in a sweet manner,

00:04:07.989 --> 00:04:12.531
"goad goad bola", means you must speak in a sweet manner.

00:04:13.115 --> 00:04:18.156
Speaking in the sweet manner is very important.

00:04:18.948 --> 00:04:23.489
Some people think it is smart to speak in a rude manner

00:04:24.073 --> 00:04:29.156
or is very intelligent to shout on people,

00:04:32.073 --> 00:04:36.406
but no one likes this kind of a personality.

00:04:37.031 --> 00:04:43.073
You may be intelligent, you may be very sharp or smart,

00:04:44.365 --> 00:04:48.405
maybe on a television people may like to see you,

00:04:49.531 --> 00:04:53.531
but not as companions, as friends.

00:04:54.156 --> 00:05:00.073
To speak in a very sweet manner

00:05:00.781 --> 00:05:07.906
is a sign of good breeding, good culture and fear of God.

00:05:08.447 --> 00:05:11.447
Those who fear God will never speak

00:05:11.989 --> 00:05:15.240
rudely to another person, because in another person

00:05:15.823 --> 00:05:18.697
also the same spirit is shining

00:05:19.198 --> 00:05:24.156
and why should we be sharp or angry with another person

00:05:24.572 --> 00:05:29.864
who is created by God Almighty as we are created.

00:05:30.781 --> 00:05:35.989
So this loving, beautiful relationship

00:05:36.447 --> 00:05:37.739
that we have with each other,

00:05:37.823 --> 00:05:39.906
after Sahaja Yoga especially,

00:05:41.405 --> 00:05:45.073
let us express in talking to each other sweetly.

00:05:45.531 --> 00:05:49.447
There are so many ways by which we could be sweet.

00:05:52.948 --> 00:05:56.240
There are little, little things if you do,

00:05:57.572 --> 00:05:59.781
you can create lot of sweetness,

00:06:00.323 --> 00:06:05.531
but you need not a sharp tongue, but a sharp memory.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.781
I try these things many a times.

00:06:09.823 --> 00:06:14.906
Once one of the Sahaja Yogi,

00:06:15.031 --> 00:06:18.406
who is a very good Sahaja Yogi and an active Sahaja Yogi,

00:06:18.823 --> 00:06:21.656
was going in the car with Me

00:06:23.156 --> 00:06:30.614
and his knife was stolen by the driver or somebody

00:06:31.073 --> 00:06:34.073
and he got very angry with the driver.

00:06:34.447 --> 00:06:37.405
I said, "Forget it, you see he is an poor man,

00:06:37.781 --> 00:06:41.697
so he has taken it away, doesn't matter, just forget it."

00:06:42.073 --> 00:06:44.406
He says, "No, it was because it's a present to me

00:06:44.739 --> 00:06:46.948
from somebody who was in Switzerland and

00:06:47.281 --> 00:06:49.781
it's a Swiss knife which I was keeping with me.

00:06:50.198 --> 00:06:54.656
So I feel sorry that I have lost it."

00:06:55.115 --> 00:06:57.240
When I went to Switzerland I bought that kind of a

00:06:57.531 --> 00:06:59.489
same knife for him.

00:06:59.989 --> 00:07:03.198
When I came, when I gave him,

00:07:03.572 --> 00:07:05.115
he didn't have words to say anything.

00:07:05.489 --> 00:07:08.489
He said, "Mother, how did You remember?

00:07:08.948 --> 00:07:10.406
After such a long time how did you manage

00:07:11.198 --> 00:07:12.447
to get this knife?"

00:07:13.198 --> 00:07:14.365
I said, "I have a very good memory."

00:07:14.989 --> 00:07:17.739
That's the trouble with Me.

00:07:18.323 --> 00:07:21.489
The memory is so good that sometimes,

00:07:21.906 --> 00:07:23.781
I just don't know,

00:07:25.823 --> 00:07:28.240
I may embarrass some people with My memory.

00:07:28.572 --> 00:07:32.405
It is that good, I don't forget anything whatsoever.

00:07:32.823 --> 00:07:34.614
I, of course, forget all the bad things,

00:07:34.989 --> 00:07:38.447
because no use remembering bad things,

00:07:39.156 --> 00:07:41.031
no use thinking of them.

00:07:41.489 --> 00:07:45.656
Because of forgiveness you can always forget the bad things.

00:07:46.198 --> 00:07:48.115
And if you remember the good things

00:07:48.781 --> 00:07:51.823
your joy becomes multiplied.

00:07:52.281 --> 00:07:54.365
If you try to remember something bad

00:07:54.864 --> 00:07:56.323
then your joy goes down.

00:07:56.739 --> 00:07:58.447
Every time you see a person try to remember

00:07:58.989 --> 00:08:01.948
what good that person has done to you.

00:08:02.365 --> 00:08:04.406
What good that person has.

00:08:04.823 --> 00:08:07.489
If you have memory for good things

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:12.240
you will have a very nice time.

00:08:12.989 --> 00:08:16.405
Now today is the day when you are all leaving India.

00:08:16.739 --> 00:08:19.073
Some of you will be leaving day after tomorrow.

00:08:19.447 --> 00:08:20.489
Whatever it is,

00:08:21.156 --> 00:08:24.365
I have to tell you one thing, that

00:08:25.031 --> 00:08:29.781
whatever was possible has been done here, for you people

00:08:30.198 --> 00:08:32.781
to give you joy and happiness.

00:08:33.156 --> 00:08:35.531
Now when you are going back,

00:08:35.906 --> 00:08:38.447
try to remember all that was said to you.

00:08:38.906 --> 00:08:40.406
All that was nice.

00:08:40.864 --> 00:08:42.323
How people praised you.

00:08:42.739 --> 00:08:45.906
How they loved you. How they were kind to you.

00:08:46.447 --> 00:08:48.365
How you met some nice people.

00:08:48.697 --> 00:08:50.823
What nice experiences you had

00:08:51.281 --> 00:08:54.906
but don't brood over things which are worthless.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.531
All right, somebody must have said something harsh to you

00:08:58.906 --> 00:09:00.906
or you might have said something harsh to someone,

00:09:01.323 --> 00:09:02.906
just forget it.

00:09:03.405 --> 00:09:05.823
Try to understand that you are spoiling

00:09:06.198 --> 00:09:08.697
your chances of enjoying life.

00:09:09.281 --> 00:09:16.948
Nobody is hurt by that so try to be extremely happy

00:09:17.489 --> 00:09:19.323
that you have met so many people,

00:09:19.781 --> 00:09:21.281
that you have had weddings,

00:09:21.656 --> 00:09:23.323
that you have seen so many weddings.

00:09:23.614 --> 00:09:27.531
We have had a nice time and every bit of it was

00:09:27.906 --> 00:09:31.073
full of joyous vibrations.

00:09:31.406 --> 00:09:34.115
Of course, today some of you would be a little unhappy

00:09:34.531 --> 00:09:38.156
I can understand that because your spouses are leaving,

00:09:38.614 --> 00:09:40.823
somebody's husbands are going away or

00:09:41.156 --> 00:09:42.781
somebody's wives are going away.

00:09:43.198 --> 00:09:44.281
So I can see some of them

00:09:44.656 --> 00:09:48.031
are looking rather miserable about it.

00:09:53.823 --> 00:09:56.281
But that's a good thing because it is out of love

00:09:56.656 --> 00:10:00.073
and out of attraction for each other,

00:10:00.489 --> 00:10:02.864
for enjoying the company of each other.

00:10:03.198 --> 00:10:05.489
That's suggestive of something very good to Me

00:10:05.823 --> 00:10:08.365
but still I would say that, after all,

00:10:08.739 --> 00:10:10.781
you are going to meet each other

00:10:11.156 --> 00:10:12.405
and remember all the good things that

00:10:12.823 --> 00:10:14.489
you have said to each other,

00:10:14.864 --> 00:10:17.989
you have enjoyed with each other and try to keep happy.

00:10:18.489 --> 00:10:21.240
Because these days will pass very fast.

00:10:21.656 --> 00:10:23.697
In Sahaja Yoga you just forget time, everything,

00:10:24.031 --> 00:10:27.489
the time passes so fast and all these things will pass over

00:10:27.823 --> 00:10:31.823
and you will be again united with your husbands or wives,

00:10:32.198 --> 00:10:33.531
whatever may be the case.

00:10:34.115 --> 00:10:37.323
So there is nothing to feel very sad about all these things,

00:10:37.572 --> 00:10:39.656
and to keep smiling and laughing,

00:10:40.115 --> 00:10:41.323
so when they are departing also,

00:10:41.823 --> 00:10:45.323
they should not feel, see your last face full of tears but,

00:10:47.447 --> 00:10:52.405
but remember the face of assurance and courage,

00:10:52.781 --> 00:10:55.156
that the hope is there,

00:10:55.489 --> 00:10:56.864
we are going to meet very soon and

00:10:57.323 --> 00:10:59.739
there is nothing to feel very sad about it.

00:11:00.156 --> 00:11:03.739
Today is the day to make joy and to enjoy everything

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:09.739
and to feel the blessings of God all around us.

00:11:10.198 --> 00:11:14.156
The Sun has come back in His own glory

00:11:14.739 --> 00:11:20.240
and we have to wish Him all success in the coming year,

00:11:20.614 --> 00:11:22.447
because in this part of Maharashtra

00:11:22.823 --> 00:11:24.739
as you know there has been no rain.

00:11:25.073 --> 00:11:27.115
There has been problems with them and

00:11:27.406 --> 00:11:28.739
we have to wish Him success

00:11:29.447 --> 00:11:34.447
so that He can bring forth the rain

00:11:35.406 --> 00:11:41.365
and all that is needed out of this solar energy

00:11:41.781 --> 00:11:44.115
that we have in this country.

00:11:46.156 --> 00:11:49.323
And you have to be beaming like the Sun

00:11:49.697 --> 00:11:51.365
when you go back to your countries.

00:11:51.948 --> 00:11:55.323
That your countries are not so hot as ours are neither

00:11:55.614 --> 00:11:59.031
you have that much of warmth there and you can find

00:11:59.405 --> 00:12:02.864
that why people are so warm and so much loving because

00:12:03.281 --> 00:12:04.906
we have the Sun with us.

00:12:05.406 --> 00:12:08.823
Now you carry the Sun with you and you give them love

00:12:09.156 --> 00:12:14.115
and affection and warmth and let them feel that the Sun

00:12:14.489 --> 00:12:17.031
has been brought from India by you.

00:12:17.365 --> 00:12:19.489
Whenever I have traveled anywhere, in any country,

00:12:19.948 --> 00:12:22.447
the Sun used to be there very bright, so they said that,

00:12:23.031 --> 00:12:25.656
there is a saying that, when the Indians travel

00:12:26.405 --> 00:12:27.906
they carry the Sun with them.

00:12:28.406 --> 00:12:30.281
Of course you can't carry the Sun in your pockets

00:12:30.948 --> 00:12:33.115
but we must be carrying it in our hearts, the Sun.

00:12:33.614 --> 00:12:35.531
That must be the reason that's why

00:12:35.906 --> 00:12:37.115
the Sun was shining so well

00:12:37.739 --> 00:12:39.240
and everybody came out with their good dresses

00:12:39.614 --> 00:12:41.405
and everything was ...were, and were enjoying.

00:12:41.989 --> 00:12:43.739
So this is what it is,

00:12:44.281 --> 00:12:46.031
that you have to carry the Sun with you

00:12:46.447 --> 00:12:50.031
speaking sweetly today and forever to each other

00:12:50.406 --> 00:12:53.156
to be friendly, to be helpful, to be kind

00:12:53.656 --> 00:12:55.198
because you are yogis,

00:12:55.531 --> 00:12:56.781
you are not ordinary people.

00:12:57.156 --> 00:13:00.240
You are yogis, you represent that category of people

00:13:00.489 --> 00:13:02.115
who are known for their righteousness,

00:13:02.365 --> 00:13:05.240
for their goodness and for their compassion and love.

00:13:05.697 --> 00:13:08.323
So I wish you all best of luck.

00:13:08.656 --> 00:13:09.948
Enjoy your journeys,

00:13:10.365 --> 00:13:13.156
enjoy everything and pass this joy

00:13:13.531 --> 00:13:14.823
that you have achieved here,

00:13:15.365 --> 00:13:16.948
to other people, to other Sahaja Yogis

00:13:17.406 --> 00:13:20.405
and to other people who are not even Sahaja Yogis.

00:13:20.823 --> 00:13:23.156
May God bless you with that.

00:13:23.405 --> 00:13:25.406
Shri Mataji speaks in Marathi.

00:13:25.781 --> 00:13:28.706
Today is an auspicious day when
we give sesame seeds

00:13:29.931 --> 00:13:32.681
to others and ask them to talk sweetly.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:36.331
We tell others but it wd be better
to tell it to ourselves also

00:13:36.405 --> 00:13:39.065
because it is easier to
tell others to talk sweetly

00:13:39.906 --> 00:13:42.073
but: “I’ll talk harshly.”

00:13:42.564 --> 00:13:44.689
This habit of ours...
But we´ve created

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.572
wrong ideas about ourselves.

00:13:49.739 --> 00:13:53.489
We don´t have any idea of the
blessings that God has bestowed upon us.

00:13:54.156 --> 00:13:57.331
God has given such a lot of
blessings to us in this country.

00:13:57.365 --> 00:14:01.314
In this country people don´t
care much for cleanliness.

00:14:01.697 --> 00:14:04.331
In this country there are
different types of germs

00:14:04.697 --> 00:14:06.998
and parasites.

00:14:07.047 --> 00:14:09.906
I feel that we have all the
parasites of the whole world

00:14:09.948 --> 00:14:12.440
in this country. We even
have parasites which

00:14:12.697 --> 00:14:15.415
can´t be found anywhere
else in the world. If these parsites

00:14:15.997 --> 00:14:19.364
go to the other countries they
won´t survive due to the cold.

00:14:19.365 --> 00:14:22.006
Due to the Sun, there
are so many parasites

00:14:22.764 --> 00:14:25.472
in this country.
Once a scientist

00:14:26.223 --> 00:14:28.598
asked Me, “How is it possible to be alive

00:14:29.115 --> 00:14:32.847
overcoming so many parasites
present in your country?”

00:14:32.989 --> 00:14:35.498
I replied: “Not only
that people are alive

00:14:35.948 --> 00:14:38.281
here but live with joy, happiness

00:14:38.656 --> 00:14:40.806
and with a lot of bliss due to this Sun”.

00:14:40.823 --> 00:14:42.489
The Sun has

00:14:42.989 --> 00:14:44.789
taught us to keep our homes and

00:14:45.198 --> 00:14:46.739
also our hearts open.

00:14:49.406 --> 00:14:52.564
In England, if you´ve to go out somewhere

00:14:52.572 --> 00:14:55.731
then you spend atleast
fifteen min just to put on

00:14:55.831 --> 00:14:57.831
the right clothes. As if

00:14:57.906 --> 00:15:00.148
to wear
a shield before going out,

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:04.665
otherwise you might catch
a cold and affect your head.

00:15:04.689 --> 00:15:07.331
This is the situation there.

00:15:07.365 --> 00:15:10.989
You can`t sit out in the open in
England or any other Western country

00:15:11.031 --> 00:15:13.989
the way you are sitting here today.

00:15:14.447 --> 00:15:18.556
Because of the weather these
countries are very cold.

00:15:21.089 --> 00:15:25.431
Even in our country there
are regions, for example

00:15:26.597 --> 00:15:29.739
if you go to the cities like
Bhuwali or other side of

00:15:29.823 --> 00:15:34.514
Nainital and Dehradun and
very close to the Himalayas, then

00:15:34.531 --> 00:15:39.240
you can find the cold
weather same as in other countries

00:15:40.031 --> 00:15:45.073
like in England and America.

00:15:45.864 --> 00:15:48.406
But in these cold
countries not even birds or

00:15:48.864 --> 00:15:50.948
insects can survive.

00:15:51.115 --> 00:15:56.197
There are a lot of forests
with beautiful flowers in them.

00:15:57.223 --> 00:15:59.056
People tell, it´s a valley of flowers.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.631
with so beautiful flowers,
as if a paradise

00:16:01.656 --> 00:16:04.539
on earth, but this
feeling is only for a moment.

00:16:04.823 --> 00:16:07.973
It is so cold there, we
can´t even open our eyes

00:16:08.056 --> 00:16:09.940
to see that beautiful place.

00:16:10.006 --> 00:16:13.114
We´ve to wear spectacles
else our eyes are hurt,

00:16:13.198 --> 00:16:14.531
because of the cold.

00:16:15.365 --> 00:16:17.115
But in spite of the cold,

00:16:17.531 --> 00:16:20.489
those countries have progressed so much.

00:16:20.572 --> 00:16:24.906
They have fought against
the nature and the cold climate

00:16:25.906 --> 00:16:28.823
and strengthened their countries.

00:16:30.697 --> 00:16:34.523
In spite of having a lot of
sun, we haven´t been able

00:16:34.531 --> 00:16:36.739
to exploit its advantages.

00:16:37.381 --> 00:16:39.473
We neglected the blessing of solar energy.

00:16:39.572 --> 00:16:41.864
We have so much solar energy in our country

00:16:42.365 --> 00:16:43.781
that if we use it,

00:16:44.115 --> 00:16:46.373
we´ll never have a
dearth of (electrical) energy.

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:48.315
Even the cars can run on solar energy.

00:16:48.406 --> 00:16:50.489
But the attention of our

00:16:50.948 --> 00:16:53.906
politicians in India is
elsewhere and due to this fact,

00:16:54.323 --> 00:16:58.323
we can´t exploit the advantages
from the Sun;

00:16:58.823 --> 00:17:00.406
it is wasted.

00:17:00.697 --> 00:17:04.240
On the contrary we suffer
from it. It is in excess.

00:17:04.323 --> 00:17:09.147
If we save it, we can do a lot of work. The
main thing to learn from the Sun

00:17:09.156 --> 00:17:12.489
is it´s capacity of giving.
It always gives, only gives.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.073
Does not take anything.

00:17:16.531 --> 00:17:18.572
Due to it´s tremendous giving power

00:17:19.031 --> 00:17:20.447
we can have rains,

00:17:20.948 --> 00:17:23.323
crops and living beings.

00:17:23.814 --> 00:17:25.856
If there were no Sun,
we would have nothing.

00:17:25.948 --> 00:17:27.823
It is due to it´s power of love

00:17:28.156 --> 00:17:30.248
we have been able to reach this state.

00:17:30.281 --> 00:17:33.164
thus we have to learn from the Sun is that

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.697
we should also develop
the power of giving.

00:17:35.948 --> 00:17:38.073
But if we look around us we will find

00:17:38.531 --> 00:17:41.148
people who always think,
"How can I save money and

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.406
keep it for myself?". Even
if I give money to spend

00:17:44.823 --> 00:17:46.614
for some program, some people

00:17:46.864 --> 00:17:49.148
still have a tendancy to
save money from that also.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:51.164
"Who asked you to save?"
"No, we just thought to save".

00:17:51.198 --> 00:17:53.356
“But for whom?" "If you´ve
been given to spend it,

00:17:53.405 --> 00:17:54.656
why do you want to save?"

00:17:54.989 --> 00:17:57.923
Because there is a tendancy
somehow to hold on to

00:17:57.989 --> 00:18:00.623
something, to suck the energy of others.

00:18:01.073 --> 00:18:04.806
This is the attitude in people
everywhere. If you go to the market,

00:18:04.864 --> 00:18:07.498
They tell you, "we´ve raised the prices".

00:18:08.006 --> 00:18:11.728
"Why?" "Because others have done it". "But
if the cost of commodities is the same,

00:18:11.752 --> 00:18:17.189
why do you raise the (selling) price?"
So the attitude is to suck anyhow.

00:18:17.272 --> 00:18:22.140
Even if for a small ceremony, they
tell me, “Shri Mataji you won´t succeed.”

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:25.123
I ask, “Why?” "Because people
are corrupt and eat (grab) money.

00:18:25.198 --> 00:18:27.281
Means, I consume food

00:18:27.739 --> 00:18:30.972
& they eat money, so we may not get along.

00:18:31.031 --> 00:18:33.106
It is such an absurd thing.

00:18:33.139 --> 00:18:35.589
Those who are responsible
for the country’s welfare,

00:18:35.906 --> 00:18:38.231
who´re the administrators
& on whom the power has

00:18:38.323 --> 00:18:41.681
been bestowed by God, even they
don´t get it that we´ve to give.

00:18:41.681 --> 00:18:43.490
One has to learn this
from the Sun that we´ve

00:18:43.514 --> 00:18:45.323
come (on this Earth)
to give and not to take.

00:18:45.323 --> 00:18:49.406
This complete change
from within has to occur.

00:18:50.656 --> 00:18:53.447
That passion one has to
have; like your mother has:

00:18:53.823 --> 00:18:56.156
"Today my son is coming;
what can I do for him,

00:18:56.572 --> 00:18:58.156
what can I cook for him?"

00:18:58.614 --> 00:19:00.697
She has that passion.

00:19:01.098 --> 00:19:04.231
Shri tries to manage with whatever
little she has; might borrow ingredients

00:19:04.281 --> 00:19:05.989
from neighbours if she doesn´t have

00:19:06.281 --> 00:19:09.073
and prepares some sweet for you.

00:19:09.323 --> 00:19:11.614
She is eager to please you.

00:19:11.906 --> 00:19:14.697
Unless and untill we
have this kind of passion,

00:19:15.073 --> 00:19:17.823
collective passion from within,

00:19:18.073 --> 00:19:20.572
and awaken this kind
of feeling about others,

00:19:20.906 --> 00:19:24.348
neither our own nor any
other country can progress.

00:19:24.398 --> 00:19:27.615
But we always have the urge to take
things from others,

00:19:27.706 --> 00:19:30.872
to plunder or to deceive others.

00:19:31.073 --> 00:19:33.781
Because of this urge

00:19:34.156 --> 00:19:36.465
our children will suffer,

00:19:36.572 --> 00:19:38.531
we will suffer and

00:19:38.948 --> 00:19:41.365
we won´t be able to achieve
anything in this country.

00:19:41.572 --> 00:19:44.531
In my in-law´s village

00:19:44.989 --> 00:19:48.697
to build a lake money
was given by the govt.

00:19:49.156 --> 00:19:51.572
in thousands for the purpose.

00:19:52.073 --> 00:19:53.823
But the lake was never built.

00:19:54.115 --> 00:19:56.606
They said, they had dug a hole but then

00:19:56.697 --> 00:19:59.481
they covered it again
since they didn´t find any water.

00:19:59.572 --> 00:20:01.556
But in fact the hole was never dug.

00:20:01.605 --> 00:20:04.664
So where did all the money go?
They sent it to Switzerland (bank).

00:20:04.723 --> 00:20:06.348
So the banks will again borrow from

00:20:06.348 --> 00:20:08.997
Switzerland and send
it again to Switzerland.

00:20:09.031 --> 00:20:10.447
If the Sun acts this way,

00:20:10.781 --> 00:20:12.447
then we won´t survive

00:20:12.447 --> 00:20:14.240
even a single day.

00:20:14.531 --> 00:20:18.581
If he alone eats (consumes)
everything, what can we eat?

00:20:18.656 --> 00:20:21.531
Today we are celebrating the SANKRANTI.

00:20:21.739 --> 00:20:26.789
Sankranti means a sort of
Kranti (revolution) by which

00:20:26.823 --> 00:20:29.206
we acquire the habit of giving.

00:20:29.231 --> 00:20:32.939
Everybody says that we
should have

00:20:33.281 --> 00:20:36.431
the habit of giving but most of the
people

00:20:36.447 --> 00:20:39.839
believe in donating
something to the priest.

00:20:39.906 --> 00:20:42.539
No, not that way.

00:20:43.031 --> 00:20:45.573
Or some people preach the art of giving

00:20:45.614 --> 00:20:47.681
just to fill their own pockets.

00:20:48.031 --> 00:20:52.281
That doesn´t have any meaning.

00:20:52.823 --> 00:20:55.198
If you don´t deserve,

00:20:55.572 --> 00:20:58.156
why should we donate you?

00:20:58.447 --> 00:21:02.206
So the question arises to
whom we should donate.

00:21:02.548 --> 00:21:06.389
In fact, in all liberty and
freedom we should see

00:21:06.656 --> 00:21:10.347
for ourselves what we
are giving for our country,

00:21:10.405 --> 00:21:13.814
our brothers, sisters and our neighbours.

00:21:14.572 --> 00:21:18.789
We should not be selfish
but give with all our heart.

00:21:18.839 --> 00:21:21.556
So that gives us special joy

00:21:21.572 --> 00:21:27.589
which I always enjoy the most.
When we give with all our heart,

00:21:27.906 --> 00:21:33.564
the joy we get can´t be compared with any
other joy. And if we want to feel that joy

00:21:33.948 --> 00:21:38.456
then only we should celebrate this
SANKRANTI festival. Means our nature

00:21:38.481 --> 00:21:42.105
should become like the Sun. He isn´t
conscious about whatever He´s doing.

00:21:42.156 --> 00:21:44.805
He does all in AKARMA(without
feeling of doing it) but is

00:21:44.864 --> 00:21:47.989
constantly burning himself and
giving you joy, light,

00:21:48.406 --> 00:21:53.115
and the essence of living
He nourishes you.

00:21:53.447 --> 00:21:56.681
We see Him every day and
many people do Namaskar also,

00:21:56.697 --> 00:21:58.747
but just for the sake of
Namaskar

00:21:58.781 --> 00:22:00.640
without imbibing his qualities.

00:22:00.823 --> 00:22:03.223
We should imbibe his
capacity of giving in our country.

00:22:03.281 --> 00:22:05.948
I told you a very small
thing: that every Sahaja yogi

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.431
should plant a banyan
tree on the sides of the road.

00:22:09.589 --> 00:22:11.606
Why do you need money
for that from the govt?

00:22:11.697 --> 00:22:13.681
Just to plant a tree
with a fence around that

00:22:13.697 --> 00:22:15.248
doesn´t need much money.

00:22:15.281 --> 00:22:17.389
This year let us do that only.

00:22:17.405 --> 00:22:18.697
How much does it cost?

00:22:19.115 --> 00:22:21.673
Even to smoke bidi (tobaco) costs more.

00:22:23.614 --> 00:22:25.706
Try to do this small thing so that

00:22:25.823 --> 00:22:27.697
you do atleast something (useful).

00:22:28.198 --> 00:22:30.323
Instead, we think how to plunder others,

00:22:30.697 --> 00:22:33.306
how to get and save money at others cost.

00:22:33.365 --> 00:22:36.281
Because of these tendancies,
our country can never progress.

00:22:36.365 --> 00:22:39.031
We didn´t have people like this before.

00:22:39.115 --> 00:22:41.156
I can tell you when I was young I saw

00:22:41.739 --> 00:22:45.015
only people who believed
in giving and never in taking.

00:22:45.065 --> 00:22:47.239
They didn´t like taking. Even
the parents wd ask their

00:22:47.263 --> 00:22:49.397
children to return if they
took anything from others.

00:22:49.465 --> 00:22:52.423
I still remember in my father´s house

00:22:52.906 --> 00:22:56.447
they had made some chairs
and an umbrella, out of silver.

00:22:57.073 --> 00:22:59.531
Everybody asked: "why did you make these?"

00:22:59.906 --> 00:23:01.614
"When there´re
marriage ceremonies,

00:23:01.614 --> 00:23:03.972
people have to hire it so
better we´ve it once for all".

00:23:04.031 --> 00:23:07.573
Then it goes on moving from one house
to another. Sometimes some people ask

00:23:07.656 --> 00:23:09.572
for it. So they had
to tell them: it´s with

00:23:09.572 --> 00:23:12.064
so and so. You´ll have
to pick it up from them.

00:23:12.115 --> 00:23:13.656
Eventualy it got lost in that way.

00:23:13.656 --> 00:23:15.614
So what I wanted to say,

00:23:15.706 --> 00:23:17.456
that was their mentality: that if we´ve

00:23:17.656 --> 00:23:19.481
surplus money, what shold be done?

00:23:19.531 --> 00:23:20.948
we should invest it for some

00:23:20.948 --> 00:23:22.864
collective purpose.

00:23:23.115 --> 00:23:24.723
If you want to construct a badminton court,

00:23:24.781 --> 00:23:26.356
everybody should be able to play there.

00:23:26.405 --> 00:23:27.697
Not that,

00:23:27.697 --> 00:23:30.115
only my children will play.

00:23:30.115 --> 00:23:31.872
If someone buys a
car, it should be able

00:23:31.906 --> 00:23:33.689
to take all the children to school,

00:23:33.781 --> 00:23:35.031
so better to buy a big car.

00:23:35.447 --> 00:23:37.739
This habit of being collective and

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:39.697
useful to others

00:23:40.281 --> 00:23:42.064
one should learn from this Sun.

00:23:42.156 --> 00:23:44.356
And today is a special
day when we should take a

00:23:44.447 --> 00:23:46.605
vow: "from today
I´ll do something which is

00:23:46.697 --> 00:23:48.644
collective". I don´t
understand how people can

00:23:48.668 --> 00:23:50.615
eat their food without
thinking about others.

00:23:50.656 --> 00:23:53.739
You don´t even worry about your
neighbors. You don´t do anything

00:23:54.406 --> 00:23:56.697
for common people. I asked you just

00:23:57.115 --> 00:23:58.856
a small thing to plant a tree.

00:23:59.531 --> 00:24:01.705
We´ve got so many
sahaj yogis in Maharashtra.

00:24:01.781 --> 00:24:03.756
Even if each one plants one tree

00:24:03.781 --> 00:24:06.864
and looks after it, that
would be very greatful

00:24:07.406 --> 00:24:09.948
to all here. Thus I request you all

00:24:10.323 --> 00:24:12.697
to do something collective.

00:24:13.115 --> 00:24:15.831
But don´t think how much I
earn or make money out of it

00:24:15.906 --> 00:24:20.156
It shouldn´t happen like the
way we give money to the priest.

00:24:20.281 --> 00:24:22.156
One should lovingly do

00:24:22.823 --> 00:24:25.447
something for the
collective with open heart

00:24:25.781 --> 00:24:27.723
and feel the joy out of it.

00:24:27.781 --> 00:24:29.697
This should happen.

00:24:30.115 --> 00:24:31.406
I don´t want to say

00:24:32.031 --> 00:24:34.189
that do everything for free. I never say

00:24:34.281 --> 00:24:36.789
that do something for free
for these people from abroad.

00:24:36.823 --> 00:24:38.781
Not at all. But these people

00:24:39.073 --> 00:24:40.948
have brought so many gifts for you.

00:24:41.406 --> 00:24:43.240
Even though I have contributed a lot,

00:24:43.614 --> 00:24:45.565
they themselves have
brought so many things

00:24:45.656 --> 00:24:47.697
for you.

00:24:48.198 --> 00:24:50.656
First I thought that

00:24:50.656 --> 00:24:55.031
these were the presents which
I had bought in Rome for you.

00:24:55.614 --> 00:24:57.781
But they told me, "No Shri Mataji,

00:24:58.198 --> 00:25:00.115
these are the gifts from us".

00:25:00.489 --> 00:25:02.281
They felt such a lot of joy

00:25:02.281 --> 00:25:04.040
to bring so many things for you.

00:25:04.089 --> 00:25:06.765
They don´t even know to
whom these gifts are given.

00:25:06.781 --> 00:25:08.823
Here I´m naming &
distributing to all but they

00:25:08.823 --> 00:25:11.115
don´t bother, they just leave it to me.

00:25:11.189 --> 00:25:13.772
But indians, we´ve a
tendency to think only about our

00:25:13.864 --> 00:25:15.031
children, our mother.

00:25:15.405 --> 00:25:18.073
Then the mother comes limping on one leg.

00:25:18.323 --> 00:25:19.847
I said, "ok".

00:25:19.897 --> 00:25:21.989
"She didn´t get nineyards saree".
(S.M.):"I don´t have".

00:25:22.864 --> 00:25:24.531
"Ok then, five yards saree will do".

00:25:24.906 --> 00:25:27.156
But it is just the opposite with them.

00:25:27.489 --> 00:25:29.864
They came with so many things,

00:25:30.240 --> 00:25:32.665
it seems they brought two
tons of gifts from abroad.

00:25:32.697 --> 00:25:35.156
Even my hands started
paining while distributing them.

00:25:35.156 --> 00:25:37.240
What I want to say that

00:25:37.614 --> 00:25:40.989
you don´t need to
give anything to them.

00:25:41.365 --> 00:25:44.206
They don´t expect anything
from you. But with your behaviour

00:25:44.240 --> 00:25:46.531
you should set an example for them,

00:25:46.623 --> 00:25:48.948
that: "We also don´t
lag behind in hospitality.

00:25:48.948 --> 00:25:52.215
we´re here to serve you when
you come, to welcome you".

00:25:52.247 --> 00:25:54.872
What´s the harm in dooing
whatever is possible for us?

00:25:54.948 --> 00:25:56.823
It doesn´t cost any money,

00:25:57.198 --> 00:26:00.173
nor any hard work. Only, we
should change our mindset.

00:26:00.489 --> 00:26:02.565
& if we don´t change
it even in Sahaja Yoga

00:26:02.572 --> 00:26:04.989
then I don´t feel that we can
change the entire

00:26:04.989 --> 00:26:07.406
humanity with Sahaja Yoga. The
most imp. quality

00:26:07.823 --> 00:26:10.164
to give others should be imbibed in us.

00:26:10.198 --> 00:26:11.489
In Sahaja Yoga your Kundaliny is

00:26:11.489 --> 00:26:13.406
awakened and you realise your spirit.

00:26:13.739 --> 00:26:15.847
It´s essence is like that of the Sun

00:26:15.906 --> 00:26:18.323
that is of giving.

00:26:18.356 --> 00:26:20.940
If you´ve seen one of my photographs,

00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:23.115
there is the Sun shining on my heart;

00:26:23.115 --> 00:26:25.739
in fact there is a Sun in my heart.

00:26:25.989 --> 00:26:28.289
And that´s why I never feel that I

00:26:28.489 --> 00:26:30.489
should plunder them.

00:26:30.489 --> 00:26:32.847
I don´t understand which part of the brain

00:26:32.906 --> 00:26:34.656
this idea comes from,

00:26:35.198 --> 00:26:37.031
to plunder them.

00:26:37.447 --> 00:26:40.031
This behaviour is very strange.

00:26:40.281 --> 00:26:41.989
That should never happen in sahaja yoga.

00:26:42.281 --> 00:26:45.214
On the contrary we must think
what we can give or do for others.

00:26:45.306 --> 00:26:47.806
Every day try to think some ideas.

00:26:47.881 --> 00:26:51.031
In Rahuri itself I´ve
started an organisation

00:26:51.073 --> 00:26:53.014
which is named as "SAHAJ STREE SUDHAR"

00:26:53.031 --> 00:26:55.572
(Association for women
welfare) or "SAMAJ SUDHAR".

00:26:55.989 --> 00:26:57.781
(Society Reform).

00:26:58.031 --> 00:26:59.873
Because through Life Eternal Trust

00:26:59.989 --> 00:27:02.065
we can´t work for the
welfare of the women.

00:27:02.614 --> 00:27:04.498
Thus we had to create this organization

00:27:04.572 --> 00:27:06.515
& it´s been registered here.

00:27:06.531 --> 00:27:08.205
Everything is done.

00:27:08.239 --> 00:27:09.998
People from Canada &
elsewhere are ready to

00:27:10.572 --> 00:27:11.781
donate for this organization.

00:27:12.073 --> 00:27:14.248
But here I don´nt find anybody
to work for it.

00:27:14.281 --> 00:27:16.489
If the local women take it upon themselves

00:27:16.664 --> 00:27:18.831
to work for this organisation
then it will work out.

00:27:19.031 --> 00:27:21.689
We have acquired a
land and all the facilities

00:27:21.739 --> 00:27:23.781
but, "we don´t find time to devote for it.

00:27:24.073 --> 00:27:25.748
How can we go to this place?".

00:27:25.823 --> 00:27:29.214
These people came from abroad with
money to donate for your organisation.

00:27:29.240 --> 00:27:30.823
Help the women emancipation.

00:27:30.823 --> 00:27:32.614
Fourteen machines are brought for you.

00:27:32.614 --> 00:27:34.731
Try to train them for
something. Can´t you see

00:27:34.781 --> 00:27:36.856
women loitering about
wihout doing anything?

00:27:36.948 --> 00:27:39.231
Make them work so that they can

00:27:39.489 --> 00:27:41.281
earn something out of it and can

00:27:41.281 --> 00:27:43.989
prosper. We should try to think about these

00:27:43.989 --> 00:27:46.747
things. How can we think
about ourselves only?

00:27:46.823 --> 00:27:48.447
So sahaja yogis should know

00:27:48.697 --> 00:27:50.281
that selfish attitude

00:27:50.614 --> 00:27:52.365
has no scope in Sahaja Yoga.

00:27:53.115 --> 00:27:54.989
We should think in
terms of global advantage.

00:27:55.281 --> 00:27:57.198
I always say, the lives

00:27:57.198 --> 00:27:58.864
of saints [vibhuti (incarnations)]

00:27:59.198 --> 00:28:00.806
are for the salvation of the world.

00:28:00.823 --> 00:28:02.906
But if it is vice versa,

00:28:03.281 --> 00:28:06.447
then finished! It has no meaning.

00:28:06.989 --> 00:28:10.281
So now you have become saints

00:28:10.614 --> 00:28:12.823
so you should behave like saints

00:28:12.823 --> 00:28:16.156
and the first quality
of a saint is giving.

00:28:16.656 --> 00:28:20.248
He just gives. I´ve
never heard of a saint plundering anybody.

00:28:20.323 --> 00:28:22.398
If a saint thinks of cheating, then

00:28:22.406 --> 00:28:24.198
he is no more a saint.

00:28:24.447 --> 00:28:29.164
It never comes to his mind. Thus
how much we can give to others,

00:28:29.240 --> 00:28:31.223
how much love we can
give, how many people

00:28:31.281 --> 00:28:33.748
we can help, all our
attention should be on this.

00:28:33.823 --> 00:28:36.114
Nowadays as there are welfare associations

00:28:36.173 --> 00:28:38.847
just for election purposes,

00:28:38.864 --> 00:28:42.323
we shouldn´t create any such
type of welfare association,

00:28:42.365 --> 00:28:43.914
But associations
in which we can

00:28:43.989 --> 00:28:46.306
work selflessly like mother´s
NIRVYAJYA (unconditional) love.

00:28:46.405 --> 00:28:48.906
Love which has no limits and is endless.

00:28:49.240 --> 00:28:51.489
When you give this
kind of love, automatically

00:28:51.864 --> 00:28:53.948
you´ll know what is to be done.

00:28:54.405 --> 00:28:56.240
Gradualy there should be an improvement.

00:28:56.240 --> 00:28:59.389
All sahaja yogis should
contribute to this collective welfare.

00:28:59.406 --> 00:29:01.823
We should dedicate
some of our time for it

00:29:01.823 --> 00:29:02.731
and

00:29:03.323 --> 00:29:05.073
work hard to achieve our goals.

00:29:05.489 --> 00:29:07.823
It shouldn´t happen that
“Shri Mataji comes, gives a talk,

00:29:07.823 --> 00:29:09.948
& when She goes everything is finished.”

00:29:09.948 --> 00:29:11.948
These people (from abroad) have done a lot.

00:29:11.948 --> 00:29:14.405
They have started schools and

00:29:14.906 --> 00:29:16.531
social welfare.

00:29:16.906 --> 00:29:18.781
We should also start something like that.

00:29:19.323 --> 00:29:21.405
Sahaja yoga shouldn´t
become just an

00:29:21.405 --> 00:29:24.406
association of lazy lumps swimming
in the oean of joy

00:29:24.906 --> 00:29:28.115
after realisation. It
shouldn´t happen this way.

00:29:28.115 --> 00:29:31.365
We should try to see
how we can help others.

00:29:31.365 --> 00:29:34.281
We should open our eyes to look around us

00:29:34.281 --> 00:29:36.614
with love and try to see what we can

00:29:37.073 --> 00:29:40.840
do for others. I haven´t
been able to move to India yet.

00:29:41.214 --> 00:29:43.497
Once I come back to India you´ll see that

00:29:43.589 --> 00:29:46.240
I´ll make everyone work.
Thus it´s better to start before.

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:48.365
Sahaja Yoga is not meant

00:29:48.365 --> 00:29:50.864
only for sitting and meditating.

00:29:50.864 --> 00:29:52.739
For meditating why do you need

00:29:53.198 --> 00:29:55.039
Sahaja Yoga? You can go the Himalayas.

00:29:55.115 --> 00:29:57.023
If you want to do Sahaja
Yoga living here then

00:29:57.073 --> 00:29:59.115
the common people should
be helped by Sahaja Yoga.

00:29:59.614 --> 00:30:01.697
But Sahaja Yoga
shouldn´t become like these

00:30:01.697 --> 00:30:03.531
modern welfare organizations.

00:30:04.406 --> 00:30:06.440
We should accomplish
it with full sincerity

00:30:06.531 --> 00:30:09.823
and only then we can say that
we´ve established Sahaja Yoga.

00:30:09.906 --> 00:30:12.739
Now I heard a lot of praise for Me.

00:30:13.281 --> 00:30:16.115
I heard the songs and it
gave Me a lot of joy and

00:30:16.489 --> 00:30:19.573
satisfaction that people
have recognized Me.

00:30:19.906 --> 00:30:21.989
But you should remember one thing –

00:30:22.240 --> 00:30:24.064
you should work in order to know yourself

00:30:24.156 --> 00:30:26.223
otherwise you can´t see yourself

00:30:26.240 --> 00:30:27.581
in the mirror.

00:30:27.806 --> 00:30:30.705
You should be able to see
what you´ve achieved.

00:30:30.823 --> 00:30:32.781
But if you continue same as before,

00:30:33.031 --> 00:30:35.365
looking after your household, your children

00:30:35.365 --> 00:30:37.731
and if you aren´t able to

00:30:37.823 --> 00:30:39.823
work for collective,

00:30:40.073 --> 00:30:42.415
then what you´ve achieved
through Sahaja Yoga?

00:30:42.447 --> 00:30:44.706
You have ramained where you were.

00:30:44.906 --> 00:30:49.064
You have not progressed
at all. Next year when I come,

00:30:49.323 --> 00:30:51.805
you should be able to tell me how many

00:30:51.948 --> 00:30:55.647
banyan trees you´ve planted.
Secondly, you should be able to

00:30:55.706 --> 00:30:57.872
tell me what collective or
social work you´ve done.

00:30:58.031 --> 00:31:00.556
If you try to look around,
you´ll definitely be able

00:31:00.572 --> 00:31:03.097
to see some collective
work which you can do.

00:31:03.115 --> 00:31:05.948
And I´m sure you´ll be
able to do it very well.

00:31:05.989 --> 00:31:07.531
It doesn´t need any money

00:31:07.948 --> 00:31:09.823
– only you have to decide in your mind.

00:31:10.365 --> 00:31:11.781
When I started Sahaja Yoga,

00:31:12.198 --> 00:31:14.139
I had given realization to one lady only

00:31:14.198 --> 00:31:16.031
and I started without any money.

00:31:16.656 --> 00:31:18.697
I didn´t have any support from

00:31:19.031 --> 00:31:20.823
the family either.

00:31:21.365 --> 00:31:24.406
But due to the dedication of the work &

00:31:24.919 --> 00:31:27.123
it´s truthfulness,
it has spread so much.

00:31:27.198 --> 00:31:28.323
Now each one of you,

00:31:28.989 --> 00:31:31.405
man or woman,

00:31:31.656 --> 00:31:35.198
has the responsibility while
introducing Sahaja Yoga to the

00:31:35.606 --> 00:31:38.556
general public, to be able
to give them some proof of

00:31:38.906 --> 00:31:42.440
general well being. You
needn´t break any law for this.

00:31:42.531 --> 00:31:44.906
Neither do anything wrong nor do

00:31:45.198 --> 00:31:48.073
anything incorrect.

00:31:48.447 --> 00:31:51.039
Only in a proper way just
watch with your eyes open

00:31:51.056 --> 00:31:52.823
what you can do for the people,

00:31:52.823 --> 00:31:55.656
how you can help the
wellbeing of the people.

00:31:55.697 --> 00:31:57.956
And I’m here to give
you all the strength and

00:31:58.031 --> 00:31:59.572
energy to do this work.

00:31:59.906 --> 00:32:01.823
We don´ need any vote,

00:32:02.198 --> 00:32:03.781
nor any money, nothing else.

00:32:04.073 --> 00:32:06.031
Just give me a promise that you´ll start

00:32:06.031 --> 00:32:08.706
working for the
welfare of the people.

00:32:08.981 --> 00:32:11.106
Sometimes when
people start some welfare

00:32:11.406 --> 00:32:13.831
work they go round asking for funds.

00:32:13.831 --> 00:32:16.031
This´s wrong. We shouldn´t ask for money.

00:32:16.031 --> 00:32:18.856
First you should start
some work which

00:32:18.948 --> 00:32:20.906
doesn´t need any money.

00:32:20.906 --> 00:32:23.498
Everyone feels that without
money we can´t do anything.

00:32:23.572 --> 00:32:26.864
You´ve got the powers,
why do you need money?

00:32:27.240 --> 00:32:29.754
If somebody is sick or not
well in your neighbourhood

00:32:29.778 --> 00:32:32.731
then you can go, visit him
and try to soothe that person.

00:32:32.739 --> 00:32:34.248
Instead of that, what I see,

00:32:34.323 --> 00:32:36.039
you bring the sick person to Me.

00:32:36.115 --> 00:32:37.447
The other day, someone brought

00:32:37.447 --> 00:32:39.340
an injured person with
a broken arm to Me.

00:32:39.389 --> 00:32:41.340
Any sahaja yogi could´ve
treated him in two min.

00:32:41.447 --> 00:32:43.440
but instead, they brought
him to Me & that too

00:32:43.531 --> 00:32:44.939
right in the
middle of a program

00:32:45.031 --> 00:32:46.531
& asked Me to treat his arm.

00:32:46.564 --> 00:32:48.498
You are so many &
all the powers are flowing

00:32:48.531 --> 00:32:50.489
through your hands but
you don´t use them.

00:32:50.823 --> 00:32:54.531
These people don´t do this. If you are
not able to treat even these small ailments

00:32:55.323 --> 00:32:59.405
what is the use of you being
a Sahaja yogi? Someone says,

00:33:00.240 --> 00:33:02.906
"my mother is sick, my
father has broken his leg.”

00:33:03.823 --> 00:33:08.031
Treat them yourself,
you do have the powers,

00:33:08.147 --> 00:33:11.189
atleast try to use them.

00:33:11.515 --> 00:33:14.856
Thus you should be able
to help the people happily,

00:33:15.073 --> 00:33:18.440
without expecting anything in
return.

00:33:18.823 --> 00:33:21.831
You will be able to feel a
lot of joy when you´ve

00:33:22.073 --> 00:33:25.256
the feeling that you don´t
do anything but you´re just

00:33:27.073 --> 00:33:29.789
an instrument of God
and you are giving

00:33:31.115 --> 00:33:34.205
something special in this
world, in this country

00:33:34.831 --> 00:33:36.889
and in these families.

00:33:36.939 --> 00:33:39.765
Such a big thing, such
a big understanding!

00:33:39.781 --> 00:33:43.081
If all of you decide to
work with this feeling then,

00:33:43.447 --> 00:33:48.072
you´ll be able to do something for others
& then people will see what Sahaja Yoga is.

00:33:48.906 --> 00:33:50.905
Just now people think
that Sahaja Yoga is–

00:33:50.948 --> 00:33:53.447
just everybody meditating
together & that’s all.

00:33:53.906 --> 00:33:56.398
Even if there´s some problem
in the country, Sahaja yogis

00:33:56.447 --> 00:33:58.572
are just sitting in meditation.

00:33:58.948 --> 00:34:00.823
One man told Me, “My wife doesn’t cook.”

00:34:00.823 --> 00:34:03.164
I asked, “Why?”
He said, “She just meditates.”

00:34:03.281 --> 00:34:05.231
I said, “Is it so? But
who told her that?”

00:34:05.281 --> 00:34:07.565
First she should cook, for meditation even

00:34:07.614 --> 00:34:09.572
five minutes are sufficient.

00:34:09.823 --> 00:34:12.073
I´ve given you the power,
to cook well.

00:34:12.073 --> 00:34:15.156
Thus one should have the

00:34:16.739 --> 00:34:20.073
confidence and the capability of work.

00:34:22.864 --> 00:34:25.073
I´m giving you the
powers, assimilate them.

00:34:25.073 --> 00:34:27.405
Just to meditate every day isn´t enough.

00:34:27.864 --> 00:34:31.506
You´ve to see what wellbeing you
are giving to others. But instead of that,

00:34:31.515 --> 00:34:34.556
you always think about your own
wellbeing. "Treat my son, get me a good job

00:34:34.605 --> 00:34:36.073
treat my mother,

00:34:36.073 --> 00:34:37.364
my father,

00:34:38.115 --> 00:34:39.281
come to my house,

00:34:39.531 --> 00:34:40.447
do this, do that".

00:34:40.656 --> 00:34:42.956
Just imposing your will upon Me

00:34:42.964 --> 00:34:46.447
but what about you?

00:34:46.906 --> 00:34:49.572
You should remember that
you also have to do something.

00:34:49.864 --> 00:34:51.931
“I´ll show Shri Mataji that I’m capable of,

00:34:51.948 --> 00:34:53.656
doing something special.”

00:34:54.031 --> 00:34:57.115
We should decide this once and for all.

00:34:57.572 --> 00:35:02.572
I have an image in front of
My eyes as Shri Gyaneshwara

00:35:02.989 --> 00:35:09.073
had described, "BOLTE PIYUSHANCHE SAGAR."

00:35:11.906 --> 00:35:15.614
(Words or sayings are
like the oceans of nectar)

00:35:16.447 --> 00:35:19.323
Where is it? I want to see it.

00:35:20.823 --> 00:35:23.405
Thus on this auspicious
day I give you all

00:35:23.906 --> 00:35:26.356
My sweet blessings that
you will help everyone,

00:35:26.405 --> 00:35:28.572
look after their wellbeing, treat

00:35:28.906 --> 00:35:32.531
everyone with love and talk sweetly

00:35:33.073 --> 00:35:35.864
with full of love.

00:36:00.115 --> 00:36:01.739
He is saying you should put your hands

00:36:02.323 --> 00:36:05.156
like this to say that you are bound by Mother's words.

00:36:05.656 --> 00:36:08.406
And we will try to do good to others and

00:36:08.781 --> 00:36:12.073
we will be very kind to each other.

00:36:16.489 --> 00:36:20.697
I've been telling them that we have to be collective

00:36:21.240 --> 00:36:23.489
not among only Sahaja Yogis but with others also.

00:36:23.864 --> 00:36:26.115
We should see surroundings, what's wrong where,

00:36:26.531 --> 00:36:31.739
how we can help. We have many social obligations

00:36:32.115 --> 00:36:33.864
which we have to fulfill.

00:36:34.240 --> 00:36:36.989
Now you have reached the stage where you can do that

00:36:37.365 --> 00:36:42.948
without forming any social organization which collects money

00:36:43.365 --> 00:36:45.864
and have saints and things that kind of a nonsense.

00:36:46.323 --> 00:36:50.281
But you can see around yourself who are the needy,

00:36:50.614 --> 00:36:52.823
to whom you can help.

00:36:53.240 --> 00:36:55.365
And that is how you can really give

00:36:55.739 --> 00:36:59.406
a very positive form to Sahaja Yoga.

00:37:15.198 --> 00:37:17.198
Marathi

00:37:35.739 --> 00:37:37.073
Rahurila

00:47:02.365 --> 00:47:05.489
I'll be giving this water to all of you

00:47:06.115 --> 00:47:11.365
all the leaders and aslo..

00:47:12.906 --> 00:47:13.948
you can take it.

00:47:14.781 --> 00:47:16.240
this water is very good for

00:47:16.697 --> 00:47:21.572
all diseases of the Mooladhara chakra.
